# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# pot-of-gold — hardened ignore. This is a PUBLIC repo. The primary control is
# "only copy in approved, reviewed artifacts"; this file is the safety net so a
# secret / licensed-data blob can never be committed by accident. Do not relax
# without an exposure review.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Secrets / credentials (NEVER commit) ──────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
*.env
!env.example            # a placeholder-only template is allowed (review before adding)
.envrc
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
*credentials*
*secret*
*_token*
*apikey*
*api_key*

# ── Licensed / heavy market data + derivatives (NOT redistributable) ───────
raw_data/
**/local_store/
*.parquet
*.npz
*.pkl
*.pickle
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.feather
*.arrow
*.csv                   # allow-list specific non-data CSVs explicitly if needed

# ── Model checkpoints / weights (data-derived) ────────────────────────────
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
ssl_model_*
*_model_v*/

# ── Run outputs / results / logs ──────────────────────────────────────────
results/
generated_qc/
mlruns/
ckpt/
*.log
*.hb
*.hb.jsonl

# ── Internal working notes / tooling (keep private) ───────────────────────
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
**/memory/
*_PRAXIS_DECISIONS.md   # internal decision trail — include a curated copy if wanted

# ── Python ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# ── OS / editor ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
